870	   868	    /// <summary>
871	   869	    /// Self-healing normalizer for commission percentage values.
872	   870	    /// The DB contract is that rates are stored as decimal fractions (0.20 = 20%).
873	   871	    /// Legacy bad saves wrote whole numbers (20.0 instead of 0.20).
874	   872	    /// Any value greater than 1.0 is assumed to be whole-number percent and is
875	   873	    /// divided by 100; values already in [0, 1] are returned unchanged.
876	   874	    /// This matches the identical logic on the frontend (toDisplayPct / toStorePct).
877	   875	    /// </summary>
